{"title":"MathLegend27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>MathLegend27 was previously called chunyan, but is now a hybrid of a MathLegend and the fabled TheLegend27. He loves math, basketball, and reading good books. He is an aspiring youtuber  as well (11 subs!). The link to his channel will be down in the Recommendations section.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#About_MathLegend27\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">About MathLegend27</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Classes_Learned_On_AoPS\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Classes Learned On AoPS</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Famous_Quotes/Admired_Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Famous Quotes/Admired Quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Recommendations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recommendations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_MathLegend27\">About MathLegend27</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathLegend27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: About MathLegend27\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<ul><li>Species = Homo Sapiens</li>\n<li>Birth Year =&#160;????</li>\n<li>Goals: Make AIME/USAMO</li></ul>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classes_Learned_On_AoPS\">Classes Learned On AoPS</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathLegend27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Classes Learned On AoPS\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<ul><li>Introduction to Geometry (Tim Black)</li>\n<li>Introduction to Number Theory (Sarah-Marie Belcastro)</li>\n<li>AMC 10 Problem Seminar</li>\n<li>Intermediate Counting and Probability (Eric Wofsey)</li>\n<li>Pre-Calculus (Kate Thompson)</li>\n<li>Intermediate Number Theory (Alyssa Zisk)</li></ul>\n<h1><span id=\"Famous_Quotes.2FAdmired_Quotes\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Famous_Quotes/Admired_Quotes\">Famous Quotes/Admired Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathLegend27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Famous Quotes/Admired Quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>\"If you truly love math, math will reciprocate that love\" \n-Anonymous\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recommendations\">Recommendations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathLegend27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Recommendations\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<ul><li>pifinity - avatar maker</li>\n<li>electro3.0 - avatar and CSS (for blogs) maker</li>\n<li>My blog - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c564251\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c564251</a></li>\n<li>My forum - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c565670\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c565670</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2026101809